cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these packings or tools, please cite them as below."
title: "Moki&Julio: 5,993 new best-known packings of equal circles, spheres and hyperspheres in twenty Packomania containers"
authors:
  - name: "Moki&Julio"
date-released: 2026-09-26
version: "2.5"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22981305
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hashirama1337s/moki-julio-circle-packing"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - circle packing
  - equal circles
  - Packomania
  - best-known packings
  - exact certificates
abstract: >-
  5,993 packings that improve the best-known records of Packomania's tables: equal circles in the isosceles right
  triangle (crt), the circular quadrant (ccq), eight fixed rectangles (crc_100 to crc_800), the semicircle (csc), the unit square
  (csq) and the regular pentagon (cpt), 15-gon (cpd) and 16-gon (cxd), equal spheres in the unit cube (scu) and in the unit sphere
  (ssp), and equal balls in the unit ball of dimension 4, 5 and 6 (hsp4, hsp5, hsp6), each with an exact certificate verified by
  two independently written exact checkers. Results already surpassed in the literature (including spherical-code constructions)
  are excluded by a prior-art gate. Also: 58 table entries proven optimal by Füredi's bound for thin rectangles and two proven
  optimal by an exact computer-assisted proof.
